  << /ActualText (Product Designer  \057  EverCommerce\nApr 2023 \055 Present\054 Toronto\054 ON\nLeading end\055to\055end design and validation of merchant\055 and customer\055facing features for Invoice Simple\054 empowering 500K\053 businesses in their day\055to\055day operations\nExpanded multichannel payments by spearheading conception and execution of tap to pay and mobile cheque capture workflows\054 driving 24\045 lift in total payment volume\nRedefined user activation journey and improved paywall messaging through funnel analysis and A\057B testing\054 growing subscription purchases by 58\045\nPiloted free trial experience to augment feature discoverability supersede freemium user acquisition model\054 increasing document creations by 27\045 and driving 10\045 skew towards higher\055tier subscription packages)
